## About SUNGSUYA Project

SUNGSUYA is an innovative Progressive Web App (PWA) for guiding popup stores in Seongsu-dong, Seoul. This project is developed through revolutionary 3-AI collaboration:

- **Claude Desktop**: Project Management + Quality Control
- **ChatGPT Plus**: Feature Development + Creative Solutions  
- **Gemini CLI**: DevOps + Automated Deployment

### Key Achievements
- 67% Performance Optimization (functions.php: 40.83KB → 13.47KB)
- 100% Location Accuracy (35 places with verified coordinates)
- Complete PWA Support (offline functionality + installable)
- Revolutionary 3-AI Collaboration System

### Technology Stack
- WordPress 6.4+ with optimized custom theme
- Progressive Web App (PWA) with Service Worker
- Responsive design for mobile-first experience
- FastComet hosting with automated deployment

For more information, visit: https://sungsuya.com

